sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Producer
    participant SW as Scriptwriter
    participant FC as Fact-Checker
    participant SEO as SEO / Metadata
    participant VD as Visual Designer
    participant DB as Database / tools
    Note over P,VD: One production run for episode W01E01 (from the simulation log)
    P->>DB: get_week_status()
    P->>SW: handoff (transfer_to_scriptwriter)
    SW->>DB: get_episode_brief()
    SW->>DB: save_script(draft 1, 8 scenes)
    SW->>FC: handoff
    FC->>DB: get_script()
    FC->>DB: save_fact_check(passed=false, 1 issue)
    Note right of FC: "Embeddings capture the exact meaning<br/>of any sentence perfectly." is an absolute claim
    FC->>SW: handoff back with the issue
    SW->>DB: save_script(draft 2, fix applied)
    SW->>FC: handoff
    FC->>DB: save_fact_check(passed=true)
    FC->>SEO: handoff
    SEO->>DB: get_channel_insights(), save_metadata(3 titles, tags, chapters)
    SEO->>VD: handoff
    VD->>DB: save_visuals(thumbnail + 9 scene images)
    VD-->>P: run ends with VD final output: "package ready for rendering and review"
    Note over P,DB: Every model call above is priced and logged per agent and per episode
